                          Group Management

groupadd <group_name>
--> to create group
groupadd devops

/etc/group file contains:

devops  :  x  :  5003  :
  1        2      3       4

  1: group name
  2: password
  3: groupID
  4: list of group members

  **Types of group:
  1. primary group
  2. secondary group

  groupdel <group_name>
  --> to delete group
  groupdel devops

  groupmod -n <new_groupname> <old_groupname>
  --> to update group name
  groupmod -n dev devops

  usermod -aG <group_name> <user_name> 
  --> to append single user to group
  usermod -aG devops seema

  gpasswd -M <user1>,<user2>,<user3>...  <group_name>
  --> to add multiple users in a group
  gpasswd -M seema,meena,priyanka  devops

  gpasswd -d <user_name> <group_name>
  --> to delete single user from group
  gpasswd -d seema devops
  

